• Following HACCP, food safety, hygiene, cleaning and health and safety procedures;
• Assisting with stock checks, deliveries, menu preparation and kitchen records;
• Supporting and supervising junior kitchen staff within the Employee’s competence; and
• Carrying out other reasonable duties consistent with the role, skills and employment permit.

The role is in a restaurant establishment and is not employment in a fast-food outlet. The Employee
